Reminders via WhatsApp, SMS, email and push
CRM, memberships and loyalty programme
Finance, payroll and inventory
Altegio.me client app
MCP server for Claude, ChatGPT and Cursor', 'manual' FROM DUAL WHERE @new = 1;
